o8dHvZvbG4kax0LcaWvrXUZuX.jpg"},{"id":1252995,"name":"Saki Fujita","role":"Miku Hatsune (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pTHZZTerlaIHXOJkIzodMr1cfH0.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Un calcio volante al Mio Demonio!","overview":"Jashin-chan, un demone dell'inferno, è stato improvvisamente convocato nel mondo umano da Yurine Hanazono, una studentessa universitaria stoica che vive in un appartamento fatiscente a Jinbocho. Sono costretti a diventare coinquilini poiché Yurine non sa come rimandare indietro Jashin-chan. Ma secondo Jashin-chan, potrebbe tornare uccidendo Yurine, quindi agirà...?! Una vipera commedia da coinquilina che ti tiene all'erta!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Drop Kick on My Devil!!","overview":"Jashin-chan, a devil from Hell was abruptly summoned to the human world by Yurine Hanazono, a stoic college student who lives in a run-down apartment in Jinbocho. They're forced to become roommates since Yurine doesn't know how to send Jashin-chan back. But according to Jashin-chan, she could return by killing Yurine, so she takes action...?! A viperous roomie comedy that keeps you on your toes!"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"魔界の悪魔、通称“邪神ちゃん”は、ある日突然人間界に召喚されてしまう。彼女を召喚したのは、神保町のボロアパートで暮らすちょっとブラックな心を持つ女子大生の花園ゆりねだった。しかもゆりねは、邪神ちゃんを魔界に帰す方法がわからないと言う。仕方なく一緒に暮らし始めた邪神ちゃんとゆりね。しかし、召喚者が死ねば魔界に帰れることから邪神ちゃんはゆりねの命を狙い……!? 少女と邪神ちゃんが繰り広げるちょっとキケンな同居生活コメディ！","tagline":"女子大生「花園ゆりね」と悪魔「邪神ちゃん」が繰り広げるちょっと危険な同居生活コメディ！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8kYrjAnzfZZN5Q7EHK8Oe9bwMHT.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8kYrjAnzfZZN5Q7EHK8Oe9bwMHT.png","language":"en","width":796,"height":252},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bS1Ym1SJ3f9YBZ7ZSgSwT19MZcC.svg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bS1Ym1SJ3f9YBZ7ZSgSwT19MZcC.svg","language":"ja","width":549,"height":303},{"type":"logo","url":"http